# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Publication boundary
#
# This repository is the published mirror of a private development repository.
# Everything below exists there and is deliberately not published here. The
# rules are what enforce that: without them a routine `git add -A` after a sync
# silently republishes material that was removed on purpose. If you are adding
# something to the private tree that must not ship here, add it here too.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Continuous integration. Every job depends on a checkout of the private
# zappMessaging sibling and on repository secrets, so the workflows could only
# ever be red here. They also name the secrets they consume.
.github/workflows/
.github/actions/
.github/scripts/
.github/dependabot.yml
.github/java-upgrade/
.github/modernize/

# Release operations reference account state; the audits and the parity ledger
# record unfixed findings, embargoed upstream security work, unreleased branch
# names and internal ticket numbers.
docs/PLAY_PUBLISHING.md
docs/RELEASE_SIGNING.md
docs/audits/
docs/notifications/PUSH_NOTIFICATION_AUDIT.md
docs/FORK_MAINTENANCE_GUIDE.md
docs/UPSTREAM_SECURITY_SYNC_GUIDE.md
docs/CI.md
BLIND_PEER_DEBUG.md
docs/android/
docs/play/
docs/GooglePlayStoreListing/

# In-flight planning documents. These describe work before it is decided, and
# routinely contain conclusions that were later reversed.
docs/*_PLAN.md
docs/HACKATHON.md
docs/HANDOVER_UI_CLEANUP.md

# Agent and assistant configuration, and local scratch clones.
.claude/
.claude-flow/
CLAUDE.md

# Solves a captcha to drip testnet funds. Not something to hand out.
scripts/testnet-faucet.mjs

# Design prototypes: raw capture dumps, not a build input
design/

# Store artwork inherited from upstream, removed rather than republished as
# this project's own. See stores/solana/media/README.md.
stores/solana/media/*.png
fastlane/metadata/android/*/images/

# Solana dApp Store config (stored privately in GCS)
stores/config.yaml

# Installed dependencies. The blind-push deployment directory is meant to have
# `npm ci` run inside it, so without this a routine `git add -A` there commits
# the whole dependency tree.
**/node_modules/
